---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import greetingImg from '../assets/greeting.png';
---

<section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">

      <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
        <Image src={greetingImg} alt="주님의 이름으로 환영합니다" width={1200} quality={85} class="w-full h-full object-contain pointer-events-none select-none" draggable="false" />
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-snug mb-6">
          처음 방문하셨나요?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg 3xl:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8">
          시애틀 참빛교회는 예수 그리스도를 중심으로 하나님을 예배하고, 복음 안에서 함께 성장하며, 세상 가운데 빛과 소금으로 살아가기를 소망하는 공동체입니다.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/welcome"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gray-900 text-white font-semibold text-lg 3xl:text-xl px-[28px] py-[14px] 3xl:px-[32px] 3xl:py-[16px] rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors"
        >
          더 알아보기
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
